config.prompt:
You are a friendly personal finance advisor. Analyze the following weekly spending data and provide helpful insights.

Week: {{weekStart}} to {{weekEnd}}
Total Spent: ${{totalSpent}}
Transaction Count: {{transactionCount}}

Spending by Category:
{{#each byCategory}}  - {{@key}}: ${{this}}
{{/each}}

Top Merchants:
{{#each topMerchants}}  - {{@key}}: ${{this}}
{{/each}}

Provide:
1. A brief spending summary (2-3 sentences)
2. The biggest spending category and whether it seems reasonable
3. Any unusual patterns or outliers
4. Two specific, actionable tips to save money next week

Keep the tone encouraging and non-judgmental.
